 MASAKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKAWARA TAKAMITSU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HAMA, YOSHIHISA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MAMETA, MASAKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKAWARA, TAKAMITSU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A chemical container which is capable of feeding chemicals by a simple operation sterilely in short time and has a slight amount of remaining liquid after feeding, comprising a container main unit (1) having a mouth part (11) closed by an easily breakable closed body (12) and a hollow needle member (2) fitted rotatably onto the mouth part (11) of the container main body (1), the closed body (12) further comprising a flat knob part (121), and a knob storing part (22) of the hollow needle member (2) further comprising a projected ring (24) which is bump-fitted to the knob part (121) when the hollow needle member (2) is rotated.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un récipient pour substances chimiques capable de distribuer des substances chimiques de manière stérile par une opération simple et dans un temps réduit, tout en gardant une faible quantité de substances chimiques après le versement, le récipient comportant une unité (1) principale de récipient dotée d'une partie de bec (11) obturée par un corps (12) fermé à rupture facile et d'un élément à aiguille (2) creux ajusté rotatif sur la partie de bec (11) de l'unité (1) principale de récipient, le corps (12) fermé comprenant également une partie de poignée (121) plate et une partie (22) de rétention en forme de poignée de l'élément à aiguille (2) creux, ainsi qu'un anneau (24) saillant monté en relief sur la partie de poignée (121) lorsque l'élément à aiguille (2) creux est tourné.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>